      <h1 class="pagetitle page-title">
        <span class="prefix">  Company portrait
</span> <span class="visually-hidden">&mdash;</span>
        <span class="text">  <p>Allow us to introduce ourselves: <strong>VP Bank</strong></p>
</span>
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div
      class="
        col-xs-1
        col-md-3
        col-lg-3
