</header>


          
      <div id="6706">

  
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--lead paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
      <div >

  
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--">
      
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-24 col-md-20 col-md-offset-2 col-lg-15 col-lg-offset-3">
              <div class="_text-left">
      
                  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type-- text-box -lead">Why should you place your trust in us? The answer is simple: because it’s all about you. Your goals are our shared goals. We’re here to support you holistically and over the long term – as a strong and reliable partner who helps you move forward. </div>
      
              </div>
          </div>
  </div>

    </div>

  
  </div>

      </div>

  
  </div>

  
      <div id="6707">

  
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
      <div >

  
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--">
        
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-24 col-md-20 col-md-offset-2 col-lg-15 col-lg-offset-3">
              <div class="_text-left">
      
                  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type-- text-box"><p>We have been living up to this extremely exacting standard for 70 years. And we know what we’re doing. In fact, a group-wide client satisfaction survey in the intermediary business and private banking conducted in the summer of 2024 showed that the vast majority of our clients are either “satisfied” or “very satisfied” with our services. But that’s still not enough for us; we strive to become even better, every day. Our team spirit and the passion of our employees make all the difference. We have a modern organisational structure that means decisions can be taken quickly and you can be as closely involved as you want. In this way, we make sure your concerns are at the heart of everything we do, day in, day out.</p><p>Ever since our foundation in Vaduz on 4&nbsp;April&nbsp;1956 by Guido Feger, a successful entrepreneur and trustee in Liechtenstein, VP&nbsp;Bank has stood for long-term security and reliability. With above-average capitalisation, strong liquidity and around 1,000 committed employees, we are one of the three system-relevant banks in Liechtenstein. Our purpose – "Partnership for progress" – reflects what drives us: identifying opportunities together with you, taking responsibility, and shaping progress.</p></div>
      
              </div>
          </div>
  </div>

      </div>

  
  </div>

      </div>

  
  </div>

  
      <div id="26465">

  
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--image-large paragraph--view-mode--default">
            <div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-24 col-md-20 col-md-offset-2 col-lg-15 col-lg-offset-3">
      <div class="image-default">
        <figure class="imagewrapper ">
