      <div id="17849">

  
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
      <div >

  
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--">
        
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-24 col-md-20 col-md-offset-2 col-lg-15 col-lg-offset-3">
              <div class="_text-left">
      
                  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type-- text-box"><p>Three anchor shareholders hold most of the VP Bank share capital, acting as guarantors of our continuity and independence. These include the “U.M.M. Hilti-Stiftung” foundation, the “Marxer Stiftung für Bank- und Unternehmenswerte” foundation and the “Stiftung Fürstlicher Kommerzienrat Guido Feger” foundation. The last of these was founded by Guido Feger in 1954 and since then has been the largest shareholder of VP&nbsp;Bank. It is therefore logical that the values of Guido Feger continue to this very day to shape our corporate culture and, along with it, our social responsibility. For years, we have used our foundations to support projects, institutions and persons that are prominent in the fields of the environment, arts, education, science and culture as a result of their outstanding efforts. We also see it as our mission to support you on your journey towards sustainability and give you the right incentives. This is why we have developed a comprehensive approach in our product landscape, which combines various aspects and allows you easy access to sustainable investments.</p><p>A matter of trust? Absolutely. For nearly 70 years, VP Bank has combined stability, personal and partnership-based advice, and innovative financial solutions. We can provide you with holistic, long-term support in the areas of wealth management, private banking and fund services. Get in touch with us and let’s start planning your route to even greater financial security.</p></div>
      
              </div>
          </div>
  </div>

      </div>

  
  </div>

      </div>

  
  </div>

    
